---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../site.config";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="About Ian Andwati, the software engineer behind Thoughts and Musings."
>
  <article class="about">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">About this place</p>
      <p class="lede">
        I’m Ian Andwati, a software engineer. This site is my durable record of
        what I learn, build, read, and find worth returning to.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <p>
        I spend my free time on hobby projects and occasionally write about the
        experience. I’m especially interested in offensive security, reverse
        engineering, computer science, and mathematics.
      </p>
      <p>
        The <a href="/writings/">writings</a> hold longer-form notes, the
        <a href="/portfolio/">portfolio</a> records finished work, and the
        <a href="/bookshelf/">bookshelf</a> keeps the sources that shaped both. The
        <a href="/archive/">archive</a> is the unfiltered chronology.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="contact">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
        <h2>Say hello</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        Email is the most reliable way to reach me:
        <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.social.email}`}
          >{siteConfig.social.email}</a
        >. You can also find me on
        <a href={siteConfig.social.github} rel="me noopener" target="_blank"
          >GitHub</a
        >.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <p class="eyebrow">For sensitive messages</p>
      <h2>PGP</h2>
      <p>
        My public key is available as a <a href="/.well-known/pgp-key.txt"
          >plain-text download</a
        >
        and on
        <a
          href="https://keys.openpgp.org/search?q=AD58AAB7A20D8523CBF59A791F20FED0AA05B0DA"
          rel="noopener"
          target="_blank">keys.openpgp.org</a
        >. The signed <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">security.txt</a> lists the
        same contact and encryption details.
      </p>
      <div class="fingerprint" aria-label="PGP fingerprint">
        <span>Fingerprint</span>
        <code>AD58 AAB7 A20D 8523 CBF5 9A79 1F20 FED0 AA05 B0DA</code>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about > header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .about > header .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 36rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  section {
    padding-block: var(--space-6);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  section a {
    text-decoration-color: var(--border);
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  section a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .contact {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(8rem, 1fr) 2fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .contact .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .fingerprint {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
  }

  .fingerprint span {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .fingerprint code {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 34rem) {
    .contact {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
